# AI News Collector

Spec-driven Python application for collecting fresh English-language AI news.

## Status

Bootstrap phase completed (T1). Implementation tasks follow Spec Kit artifacts in `.specify/`.

## Requirements

- Python 3.12+
- `uv` (recommended) or `pip`

## Quick Start

```bash
uv venv
source .venv/bin/activate
uv pip install -e ".[dev]"
```

## Project Layout

```text
src/app/
  cli/
  config/
  core/
  ingest/
  storage/
tests/
  unit/
  integration/
.specify/
```

## Spec Artifacts

- `.specify/memory/constitution.md`
- `.specify/specs/001-ai-news-collector/spec.md`
- `.specify/specs/001-ai-news-collector/plan.md`
- `.specify/specs/001-ai-news-collector/tasks.md`

## Planned CLI Commands

- `ai-news fetch --once`
- `ai-news top --hours 24 --limit 30`
- `ai-news search --query "..." --days 7`
- `ai-news sources`

## Development

```bash
ruff check .
pytest
```

